{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are confined in a mysterious tower with the option to go upstairs or downstairs. Choose wisely to escape. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If everything is normal, proceed upstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you notice an anomaly, go downstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do not miss too many anomalies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may access the roof through the emergency exit on floor 13.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of unique anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a difficulty: normal, hard, or nightmare (must be unlocked by finishing hard difficulty)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings based on your performance</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can toggle the camera head bob and enable a reticle if you are prone to motion sickness. There is a FOV slider as well. You can also customize the graphics settings to play on a variety of PC hardware. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578120?t=1742492691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578120?t=1742492691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578120/f55dd9f906fa93234cf0885efdce0bc5ead271f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742492691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578120/f55dd9f906fa93234cf0885efdce0bc5ead271f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742492691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are confined in a mysterious tower with the option to go upstairs or downstairs. Choose wisely to escape. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If everything is normal, proceed upstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you notice an anomaly, go downstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do not miss too many anomalies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may access the roof through the emergency exit on floor 13.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of unique anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a difficulty: normal, hard, or nightmare (must be unlocked by finishing hard difficulty)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings based on your performance</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can toggle the camera head bob and enable a reticle if you are prone to motion sickness. There is a FOV slider as well. You can also customize the graphics settings to play on a variety of PC hardware. </p>","developers":["Hidden Palace"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578120/5077e3d7b5b00fadffc729ad02649e91e5a78d24/header.jpg?t=1742492691","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111510,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111510/movie480.mp4?t=1742492113","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111510/movie_max.mp4?t=1742492113"},"name":"Preview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111510/63618135e2a3e990734859166a7875ce55a8014c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742492113","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111510/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742492113","max":"http://